# Build artefacts for the DBOS Go qualification kernel.
# Source files (main.go, go.mod, go.sum, build.sh, build.ps1, README.md)
# are tracked in git; build outputs are not.

# Compiled binary
dbos-qualify.exe
dbos-qualify

# Go test binaries
*.test

# Runtime state (per-instance store dirs)
.dbos-stores/

# Optional offline lock (regenerated by `go mod verify`)
go.sum.lock
